    "markdown": "<a id='a6468473-f7f8-403b-be74-f8838b56f024'></a>\n\nU.S. Department of Justice\nWashington, D.C. 20530\n\n<a id='4caf61e2-417b-4acb-906e-5233ff253e33'></a>\n\nDissemination Report\n\n<a id='02cca12e-9b3a-41d8-a23d-27273f0ce560'></a>\n\nOMB No. 1105-0006\nApproval Expires Oct. 31, 1983\n\n<a id='196b8ceb-8979-4596-9ca9-c3cc020b8655'></a>\n\nINSTRUCTIONS: Report must be submitted in duplicate to the Registration Unit, Internal Security Section, Criminal Division, Department of Justice, Washing-ton, D.C. 20530. The original must be signed by or on behalf of the registrant. All items in this form must be answered, unless the answer is \"none\" or \"not appli-cable,\" in which case such an entry shall be made in the appropriate space. If additional space is needed for any item, attach supplemental sheet identifying each item.\n\n<a id='3a475c63-22c6-4567-ba44-e2199c911d6c'></a>\n\n<table id=\"0-1\">\n<tr><td id=\"0-2\" colspan=\"2\">1. Name of registrant\n\nThe Office of Tibet</td><td id=\"0-3\">2. Registration No. 1699</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-4\" colspan=\"3\">3. Nature of material (A concise account of the nature of the propaganda material filed)\nnewsletter</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-5\">4. Title of material, if any News Tibet, January-April 1993</td><td id=\"0-6\" colspan=\"2\">5. Name of foreign principal on whose behalf this material\nwas transmitted.\n\nHis Holiness the Dalai Lama</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table id=\"0-7\">\n<tr><td id=\"0-8\">6. Means of transmission\nmail</td><td id=\"0-9\">7. Dates of transmission\nApril end</td><td id=\"0-a\">8. Total copies transmitted\n5000</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table id=\"0-b\">\n<tr><td id=\"0-c\">9. List addresses from which this material was transmitted: The Office of Tibet 241 East 32nd Street New York, New York 10016</td><td id=\"0-d\">10. List states and territories of the United States to which material was transmitted: all states of the union</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-e\">11. Types of recipients (Give number of organizations in each group)</td><td id=\"0-f\" rowspan=\"7\">12. List names and addresses of persons or organizations\nreceiving 100 copies or more:\n\nnone\n\n- 97 20</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-g\">Libraries                                 70</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-h\">Public officials                          US Congress</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-i\">Newspapers                                40</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-j\">Press services of\nassociations                              20</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-k\">Educational\ninstitutions                              60</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-l\">Civic groups\nUN missions\nOther (specify)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<a id='22d0a1fa-932c-41e4-8039-bbe79f9f0c4c'></a>\n\n13. If the material transmitted was a film or radio or television script, furnish the following information:\n\nName of station, organization, or theater using\n(including city and state)\n\nN/A\n\nDate or dates broadcast or shown\nEstimated attendance\n(for film(s))\n\n<::attestation: Official Stamp\nStatus: Received\nReadable Text: RECEIVED CRIMINAL JUSTICE DIVISION MAY 20 PM 3:11 INTERNAL SECURITY REGISTRATION UNIT\nShort description of visual elements and positioning: A diagonal, faint stamp overlaying the right side of the document, partially obscuring text.::>\n\n<a id='9b6aaa01-96e2-4380-bca3-9520ecf38ce2'></a>\n\n<::attestation: Official Receipt Stamp\nStatus indicators - Received\nReadable Text: DEPT. OF JUSTICE CRIMINAL DIVISION 93 MAY 25 PM 3:11 INTERNAL SECURITY SECTION REGISTRATION UNIT\nShort description of visual elements and positioning: A rectangular stamp with text rotated approximately 90 degrees clockwise, indicating receipt by a government agency.::>\n\n<a id='b7a24523-9f08-47b2-9ac4-e68762a3b151'></a>\n\n<table id=\"0-m\">\n<tr><td id=\"0-n\">14. Have two copies of this material been filed with the Department of Justice? Yes ☒ No ☐</td></tr>\n<tr><td id=\"0-o\">15. Has this material been labeled as required by the